      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Urban planners address this unpredictable \"noise\" by employing robust modeling techniques like microscopic traffic simulation, which incorporates individual driver behavior models. They also utilize adaptive signal control systems that dynamically adjust timing based on real-time demand, mitigating sudden surges. Furthermore, geometric design measures, such as adequate storage lengths, provide buffers to absorb minor, unforeseen fluctuations in traffic arrival rates.",
